.env
# Week5-Phase7 / Stage 0: the two 200-episode trace files are ~24 MB of DERIVED data that
# rebuilds in ~37 min each. Their sha256 digests and full per-episode summaries ARE committed
# in meta_final_*.json, and the enriched infeasible corpus extracted from them is committed in
# full, so every Stage 1 gate except the final-tier L2-L4 sweep runs from what is in git.
#   python -m experiments.exp7_0_trace_corpus --tiers final --conditions fixed randomized
results/week5_phase7/stage0_trace_corpus/trace_final_*.npz
# HD Experiment 1: per-step traces are derived bulk; every episode re-runs deterministically from
# its seed. Their sha256 digests are committed next to the records (results/highdim/*/traces.sha256).
results/highdim/**/*.traces.jsonl.gz
results/highdim/**/*.traces.partial.jsonl

# RS Experiment 1: per-step trace sidecars are derived bulk; every episode re-runs
# deterministically from its (cell, seed) and the run's commit. Their sha256 digests are
# committed next to the records (results/robustsuite/*/traces.sha256).
results/robustsuite/**/*.traces.jsonl.gz
results/robustsuite/**/*.traces.partial.jsonl
# The phase 5 parameter search's per-configuration records: 19 intermediate blocks whose whole
# conclusion is in results/robustsuite/RS5/search.json. The tuning and final blocks are committed.
results/robustsuite/RS5/search/**/*.jsonl
